### Logowanie poprawne -> 200 + JSON użytkownika
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "tester42", "password": "haslo1234" }

### Logowanie złym hasłem -> 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "admin", "password": "zlehaslo" }

### Wylogowanie -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout